{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30386","headline":"题崇圣寺简云端僧录 · 赵嘏","name":"题崇圣寺简云端僧录","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮尘飘尽客愁长，来扣禅关月满廊。\n宋玉逢秋空雪涕，净名无地可容牀。\n高云覆槛千岩树，疎磬含风一夜霜。\n回首故园红叶外，只将多病告医王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}